node_modules/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.tmp/
.claude/
.worktrees/

# Internal design docs (specs, plans) — kept locally, not pushed.
docs/superpowers/
docs/plans/
docs/specs/

# TypeScript build output.
# The ROOT dist/ is deliberately COMMITTED. Plugin installs are npm-pack
# shaped (package.json `files`): a deployed plugin carries bin/ and dist/ but
# NO lib/, scripts/, tsconfig.json or packages/, so it cannot be built on the
# user's machine. A checkout must therefore already hold a runnable compiler.
# CI (`dist-fresh` job) fails if the committed dist/ drifts from the sources.
packages/*/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Bridge artifacts (generated by Bridge in user repos, not versioned here).
docs.config.yaml
.bridge/
bridge-ds/
